<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Distribution (Amendment) short title. Act 1997."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@> .
