<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@/~cl_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Subsection 6(1) of the principal Act is amended — Amendment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@> .
