<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@/~cl_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by renumbering paragraph (v) as paragraph (j)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@> .
