<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any distribution of the property of an intestate that savings has been commenced before the commencement of this provision Act shall be continued or concluded in all respects as if this Act had not been passed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/29/eng@> .
